# This directory is copied into consuming repositories by Purview.DotNetProjectSdk
# so AI agents can discover the bundled skills.
# Keep this file if you want the generated skill content to stay out of source control.
# To disable generation entirely, set <EnableEmbeddedAgentSkills>false</EnableEmbeddedAgentSkills>
# in your project or Directory.Build.props.
*
!.gitignore
